<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hanover Compressor begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hanover Compressor begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Tuesday it started coverage of Hanover Compressor Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 7/16 to 23-9/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
